@startuml
!include <C4/C4_Component>

title AcTrail Live Tool Projector - Target Component Boundary

LAYOUT_LEFT_RIGHT()

Container_Ext(LlmPipeline, "LLM Action Pipeline", "提供标准化 LLM actions、projected tool results 与 request lineage context")
Container_Ext(SemanticStorage, "Semantic Output Sink", "接收 LiveSemanticActionOutput 并持久化 actions、links 与 diagnosis events")
Container_Ext(RuntimeConfig, "Runtime Configuration", "提供 agent invocation policy 与 per-trace capacity")

Container_Boundary(LiveRuntime, "Live Semantic Action Runtime") {
    Component(RuntimeCoordinator, "Live Runtime Coordinator", "live/runtime.rs", "Tool Projector 的唯一调用者；合并各投影器输出并负责统一落盘")

    Boundary(ToolModule, "live/tool/ — module boundary") {
        Component(ProjectorFacade, "ToolInteractionProjector", "tool/projector.rs", "唯一 façade；编排增量投影、有输出终结和无输出遗忘")
        Component(Contracts, "Projection Contracts", "tool/contract.rs", "ToolProjectionBatch、ToolProjectionOutput 与模块级配置 DTO")

        Boundary(Internal, "tool/internal/ — implementation private") {
            Component(Declaration, "Declared Call Interpreter", "internal/declaration/", "从 llm.response attributes 解码 DeclaredLlmToolCalls 和 decode report")
            Component(Correlation, "Agent Invocation Correlator", "internal/correlation/", "选择 call-result 与 invocation-child 候选；拥有 PromptFingerprint 值对象")
            Component(State, "ToolInteractionState", "internal/state/", "一致性聚合根：独占 records、lookup indexes、trace ownership、admission/eviction 和 cleanup")
            Component(Emitter, "ToolSemanticEmitter", "internal/emission/", "持有本批输出并物化 tool actions、tool-specific links 与 diagnosis events")
        }
    }
}

Rel(LlmPipeline, RuntimeCoordinator, "提交 ActionBatch")
Rel(RuntimeConfig, RuntimeCoordinator, "提供已验证配置")
Rel(RuntimeCoordinator, ProjectorFacade, "project(batch) / finish_trace(trace, at) / forget_trace(trace)")
Rel(ProjectorFacade, Contracts, "接收借用型 batch；返回 output")
Rel(ProjectorFacade, Declaration, "解释 response 中声明的 tool calls")
Rel(ProjectorFacade, Correlation, "请求绑定 tool result 或 child request")
Rel(Correlation, State, "通过语义查询读取候选；不访问裸 map")
Rel(ProjectorFacade, State, "原子 record/admit/finalize/forget")
Rel(ProjectorFacade, Emitter, "提交已判定的 projection transition")
Rel(Correlation, Emitter, "提交绑定结果与置信度")
Rel(Emitter, Contracts, "累积 actions、links 与 diagnosis events")
Rel(ProjectorFacade, RuntimeCoordinator, "返回 ToolProjectionOutput")
Rel(RuntimeCoordinator, SemanticStorage, "合并后输出 LiveSemanticActionOutput")

note right of ProjectorFacade
  对 live 外部的能力约定：
  * project — 消费一个一致的标准化批次
  * finish_trace — 物化未完成状态并清理
  * forget_trace — 无输出地释放 trace 状态

  不暴露 decoder、records、indexes、fingerprint、
  eviction 类型或任何内部 map。
end note

note bottom of State
  状态不变量：
  1. 每个主记录都属于一个 trace ownership index
  2. 每个 lookup entry 都能回到主记录
  3. 删除主记录时同步删除 lookup 与 eviction order
  4. 每个 trace 的状态受配置上限约束
  5. finish/forget 后该 trace 不残留状态
  6. 定点清理 O(k log n)，禁止扫描全局状态
end note

note bottom of Emitter
  Emitter 拥有输出批次，避免只用无状态空 Factory
  对平铺函数做形式化包装。运行期错误 fail-local，
  通过 diagnosis event 返回而不是向上游 panic。
end note

SHOW_LEGEND()
@enduml
